sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Holocene Chamaeleo calyptratus Turing wavelength at 260.4 µm (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 86.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Schnakenberg carrier (analytical λ = 260.55 µm, saturated flank λ = 254.3 µm, sweep r = 0.999, dispersion r = 0.998, ablation ratio 1.9e-4) and closes three Pass-1 gaps. The animation now lays the saturated bars onto the skin and leaves the enclosure as the photograph. Orientation and coherency are measured on a flank ROI that drops the rock above the dorsum and the sand under the belly (flank gradient 88.6 deg versus field 79.7 deg). The GIF caption no longer uses a glyph the bitmap font cannot draw. Weighted score moves from 81.4 to 86.3. A second assessor is still absent. Overall 86.3/100 (faithfulness 85.6, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/chamaeleo_calyptratus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 1092561 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 9f12527c529ae71266872baffb070028cbc3e624721c77919c9e3e400f95f0a7 (sha256 9f12527c529ae71266872baffb070028cbc3e624721c77919c9e3e400f95f0a7), spec_fingerprint 6475b1431772fac61c5a57dfa5cde945b3400d8a6722139a1e4cfa44c65c4959. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 6475b1431772fac61c5a57dfa5cde945b3400d8a6722139a1e4cfa44c65c4959; artifact_sha256: 9f12527c529ae71266872baffb070028cbc3e624721c77919c9e3e400f95f0a7. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Murray 1981 wavenumber for a two-species reaction-diffusion system. | Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics du/dt = Du lap u + A - u + u^2 v, dv/dt = Dv lap v + B - u^2 v. | Ligon & McGraw 2013: male Chamaeleo calyptratus change lateral stripe brightness during contests. | Teyssier et al. 2015: chameleon skin has a tunable guanine-nanocrystal iridophore lattice, measured on Furcifer pardalis at a spacing of order 100 nm.; reconstructed_in_script: A = 0.062, B = 1.150, supercritical factor 1.45, Dv_y/Dv_x = 0.42, so the most-unstable wavelength is the 260.4 µm slot scale and the pattern is a vertical bar. | Flank ROI: saturation mask, then the central band of the animal bounding box. The 80 µm and 2.604 mm cutoffs are scale-separation definitions at 0 Ma, not caliper readings.; transfer_boundary: Dermal chromatophore anatomy is transferred from the panther chameleon to C. calyptratus. The 260.4 µm carrier is the slot scale.; does_not_claim: Does not claim a calibrated micrometre period read off the Wikimedia photograph. | Does not claim the guanine lattice spacing is 260.4 µm. | Does not claim a second independent assessor.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: the last GIF frames paint the carrier onto the skin and keep the enclosure.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: orientation and coherency use the flank ROI.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: the GIF caption is ASCII.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Still open: one assessor. No second provider ran in this session.', 'status': 'open'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'Still open: one unscaled photograph. The 260.4 µm figure is the slot scale, not a caliper period.', 'status': 'open'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.863"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (single builder-assessor; no second provider)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000> .
}

